# No Git LFS. See DECISIONS #9: total asset weight is three orders of magnitude under any
# reason to migrate, and a half-migrated repo (old PNGs plain, new PNGs pointers) is
# indistinguishable in a diff. Re-add the filter lines in the same commit that installs
# git-lfs and runs `git lfs migrate import`, never before.

* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.glb binary
*.bin binary
*.pdsts binary
